{"id":"ciu_me","lemma":"ciúme","pos":"noun","rank":3691,"glosses":["jealousy"],"ipa":"/siˈũ.mi/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ciúmes"},"examples":[{"text":"Eu fiquei com ciúme.","en":"I got jealous.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/489879","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Ele estava com ciúme da esposa.","en":"He was jealous of his wife.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"with"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"husband","l":"esposo"}]},{"text":"Senti um pouco de ciúme.","en":"I felt a bit jealous.","words":[{"g":"to sense","l":"sentir"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"slightly"]]},{"text":"Você tem simplesmente ciúme, nada mais.","en":"You're just jealous, that's all.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"simply, merely"},null,{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"more"}]},{"text":"O motivo para o assassinato foi o ciúme.","en":"Jealousy was the motive for the murder.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"motive"},{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"murder"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}